A team adds this timeout helper and calls `await withTimeout(fetch(url), 5000)`. Which statement about it is accurate?

```js
function withTimeout(p, ms) {
  return Promise.race([
    p,
    new Promise((_, reject) => setTimeout(() => reject(new Error('timeout')), ms)),
  ]);
}
```

