What is logged, in order?

```js
const thenable = {
  then(resolve) {
    console.log('then called');
    resolve(42);
    resolve(99);
  },
};
(async () => {
  console.log('before');
  const v = await thenable;
  console.log(v);
})();
console.log('sync end');
```

Consider this polling loop:

```js
async function* poll() {
  try {
    while (true) {
      yield await fetchStatus();
      await sleep(1000);
    }
  } finally {
    console.log('cleanup');
  }
}

for await (const status of poll()) {
  if (status === 'done') break;
}
```
