What is wrong with this async queue?

```js
function createQueue() {
  const waiting = [];
  return {
    next() {
      const { promise, resolve } = Promise.withResolvers();
      waiting.push(resolve);
      return promise;
    },
    push(value) {
      waiting.shift()?.(value);
    },
  };
}
```

What is `total`, and roughly how long does this take? `sleep(ms)` returns a promise that fulfils after `ms` milliseconds.

```js
const total = await [1, 2, 3].reduce(async (accP, x) => {
  await sleep(100);
  const acc = await accP;
  return acc + x;
}, 0);
```
